       "<span class='step-label'>Step 2:</span> A distance of exactly 0 has no separate negative case, because 0 and −0 are the same number. There is only ONE equation, and the bars simply drop.\n• x + 1 = 0",
       "<span class='step-label'>Step 3:</span> Get x alone. Subtract 1 from BOTH sides.\n• x + 1 {n:− 1} = 0 {n:− 1}\n• Left side: 1 − 1 = 0, so x is left\n• Right side: 0 − 1 = −1\n• So x = −1",
       "<span class='step-label'>Step 4:</span> Final answer: <span class='ex-red'>x = −1</span>",
