       "<span class='step-label'>Step 4:</span> Put the two parts together to get the GCF.\n• GCF = 4 · x² = 4x²",
       "<span class='step-label'>Step 5:</span> Divide each term by the GCF, 4x².\n• 8x³ ÷ 4x² = 2x\n• 12x² ÷ 4x² = 3",
