       "<span class='step-label'>Step 7:</span> Check by multiplying the GCF back in.\n• 4x² · 2x = 8x³\n• 4x² · 3 = 12x²\n• Together: 8x³ + 12x², which matches the problem",
       "<span class='step-label'>Step 8:</span> Final answer: <span class='ex-red'>4x²(2x + 3)</span>",
