       "<span class='step-label'>Step 4:</span> Put the two parts together to get the GCF.\n• GCF = 6 · x = 6x",
       "<span class='step-label'>Step 5:</span> Divide each term by the GCF, 6x.\n• 12x² ÷ 6x = 2x\n• −18x ÷ 6x = −3",
