       "<span class='step-label'>Step 7:</span> Check by multiplying the GCF back in.\n• 6x · 2x = 12x²\n• 6x · (−3) = −18x\n• Together: 12x² − 18x, which matches the problem",
       "<span class='step-label'>Step 8:</span> Final answer: <span class='ex-red'>6x(2x − 3)</span>",
