       "<span class='step-label'>Step 2:</span> Find the mean first.",
       "<span class='step-label'>Step 3:</span> The mean is the sum of all the values divided by how many values there are.\n• Mean = sum ÷ count",
       "<span class='step-label'>Step 4:</span> Add the values one at a time, left to right.\n• 4 + 8 = 12\n• 12 + 6 = 18\n• 18 + 2 = 20\n• 20 + 10 = 30\n• So the sum is 30",
       "<span class='step-label'>Step 5:</span> Count the values.\n• There are 5 values: 4, 8, 6, 2, 10",
       "<span class='step-label'>Step 6:</span> Divide the sum by the count.\n• 30 ÷ 5 = 6",
       "<span class='step-label'>Step 7:</span> Now find the median.",
